{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And the ear of the wise</b> — bearers of beams seek to hear knowledge."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The phrase סובלי הקורות (\"bearers of beams\") is idiomatic; taken to mean those who shoulder heavy loads, i.e., the burdened, yet even they seek knowledge. Translation is hyper-literal; the idiom is preserved without expansion."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:30.323915936Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}